#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:3
#: 5b491b3b511a4307b0916630cb66c7d5
msgid "磁矩无序采样（Moment Disorder）"
msgstr "Moment Disorder"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:5
#: 4df74310cb3b4deb954e5e00c30bc6bd
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:7
#: 7136b4d24faa449a9160d1a81d1e3928
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:9
#: 68cd38095c4449da93796e836b7abf53
msgid "输入结构已有磁矩，希望随机改变其中一部分磁矩的方向时使用。每个输出都是一张新的磁矩构型，例如从 FM/AFM 参考态生成 10%、30%、50%、70% 的逐级无序样本。"
msgstr ""
"Use this card when the input already has magnetic moments and the directions of a "
"random subset should be changed. Every output is a new moment configuration, for "
"example a sequence of 10%, 30%, 50%, and 70% disorder generated from an FM/AFM "
"reference state."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:11
#: 25a7e9196e7349c282eb38ed99550635
msgid "例如结构中有 10 个非零磁矩，改变比例为 `0.3`："
msgstr "For example, if a structure has ten nonzero moments and the changed fraction is `0.3`:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:13
#: d60675aee43f44ba831591fa4ee59312
msgid "10 个可选磁矩 × 0.3 → 随机选择 3 个磁矩 → 按所选方式改变方向\n"
msgstr ""
"10 eligible moments × 0.3 → randomly select 3 moments → change their directions using"
" the selected method\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:17
#: 2cd4ccae42484a408c935875ffd58cce
msgid "三种模式的区别："
msgstr "The three modes differ as follows:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: 60bb00e0c4034897a5887586d55eee57
msgid "模式"
msgstr "Mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: bbc8ede44afc4a2fb775ee869b63e9db
msgid "选中磁矩如何变化"
msgstr "How Selected Moments Change"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: c819fa8b77d149d299109a58d0428b04
msgid "典型用途"
msgstr "Typical Use"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: 8befee6d23fd4bc19682fda91afab0d1
msgid "翻转选中的磁矩"
msgstr "Flip selected moments"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: 610df6f1fb9f46778ebf87445631974d
msgid "$\\mathbf m_i'=-\\mathbf m_i$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: dfe6ad9bf3964850a3a92a4932cca3e6
msgid "共线磁态的逐级翻转"
msgstr "Progressive flipping of a collinear magnetic state"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: 0865cd36de00494482fc112515dc79ad
msgid "给选中磁矩随机方向"
msgstr "Assign random directions to selected moments"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: fa5e8b888af1437d8f11a3405fff2086
msgid "在完整球面随机取新方向"
msgstr "Sample new directions over the full sphere"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: a1c4684a4ec94b228e0d4b5fcbf626bd
msgid "强方向无序"
msgstr "Strong directional disorder"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: 8e5bcc3ebd134e408f4eeafd7bc8698a
msgid "在圆锥内偏转选中磁矩"
msgstr "Tilt selected moments within cones"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: b50c85a4994d470eb17f3dda4d1c56ad
msgid "在原磁矩方向周围的圆锥内取新方向"
msgstr "Sample a new direction in a cone around each original moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md
#: 733041c671b6424cbcee1e00edd667c2
msgid "有序态附近的非共线扰动"
msgstr "Noncollinear perturbations around an ordered state"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:25
#: b83843afc3db437294d35e3bb822405e
msgid "三种模式都保持每个磁矩的模长不变。"
msgstr "All three modes preserve the magnitude of every moment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:27
#: 07a8b6ae1c484823b07a5efc8222c61e
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:29
#: 41cf2e7f0b1544a7b44b95d7b7e3338c
msgid "先从非零磁矩中找出符合“目标元素”的原子。设可选原子数为 $N_m$，当前改变比例为 $f$，则随机选择"
msgstr ""
"The card first finds atoms among the nonzero moments that match `Target elements`. If"
" $N_m$ atoms are eligible and the current changed fraction is $f$, it randomly "
"selects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:31
#: 479b99df9416499c95d27e08b1fdb48a
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{change}}=\\min\\!\\left(N_m,\\max\\!\\left[1,\n"
"\\operatorname{round}(fN_m)\\right]\\right)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:36
#: 787532823b8e4199b4e54428312ba16e
msgid "个不重复原子。因为原子数是整数，实际比例可能与输入值略有差异；只要 $f>0$，至少改变 1 个可选磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"distinct atoms. Because atom counts are integers, the realized fraction may differ "
"slightly from the input. Whenever $f>0$, at least one eligible moment is changed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:38
#: a7aba070df5f4934a4fba5100f04ea2b
#, python-brace-format
msgid "锥形无序不是在固定的全局轴附近采样，而是分别以每个被选中磁矩的当前方向为锥轴。若最大锥角为 $\\theta_{\\max}$，程序均匀采样"
msgstr ""
"Cone disorder is not sampled around one fixed global axis. Instead, the current "
"direction of each selected moment is used as that moment's cone axis. For a maximum "
"cone angle $\\theta_{\\max}$, the program samples uniformly"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:40
#: 7a8014e64c7e452a8ba515683282af70
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\cos\\theta\\sim U(\\cos\\theta_{\\max},1),\\qquad\n"
"\\phi\\sim U(0,2\\pi).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:45
#: c71a2280203f4eef928727ab6a77fc60
msgid "每个输入结构请求的输出数为"
msgstr "The requested output count for each input structure is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:47
#: ff763321c19a48c7b18d4babe7c6ad3e
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{request}}=N_f\\times N_s,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:51
#: 7241137c8e9c4b3492c1949831115a92
msgid "其中 $N_f$ 是比例个数，$N_s$ 是“每个比例的样本数”。实际输出不超过“每个输入的最大输出数”，并按比例顺序截断。"
msgstr ""
"where $N_f$ is the number of fractions and $N_s$ is `Samples per fraction`. The "
"actual output count does not exceed `Maximum outputs per input` and is truncated in "
"fraction order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:53
#: 8020c71cd9f44b8b9ec576a852351f39
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:55
#: b2efec6c9d7a49c68404f79e6a06d7ad
msgid "已有一张带 Fe/Co 磁矩的结构，希望生成 10% 到 70% 的共线翻转样本："
msgstr ""
"Suppose a structure already contains Fe/Co moments and collinear flip samples from "
"10% through 70% are needed:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:57
#: 2795f9323a844af689438c9a2fc85a12
msgid "选中的磁矩如何变化：`翻转选中的磁矩`"
msgstr "How selected moments change: `Flip selected moments`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:58
#: e92f55c62ede47f68a0f82c3a4226552
msgid "改变磁矩的比例：最小值 `0.1`、最大值 `0.7`、步长 `0.2`"
msgstr "Changed-moment fraction: minimum `0.1`, maximum `0.7`, step `0.2`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:59
#: d6ca8035104c457482dea5dc2ac4c858
msgid "每个比例的样本数：`3`"
msgstr "Samples per fraction: `3`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:60
#: d1a1dbf0cdcb4a88a93c1506067d4d94
msgid "使用随机种子：开启"
msgstr "Use random seed: on"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:62
#: a1d2cf02e91948119a3f2d6246f4288e
msgid "比例为 `0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7`，所以每个输入请求 $4\\times3=12$ 张结构。不同样本会随机选择不同原子。"
msgstr ""
"The fractions are `0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7`, so each input requests $4\\times3=12$ "
"structures. Different samples randomly select different atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:64
#: 32acbbadf8c045509304dc7596d3e76a
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:66
#: 83248d6df55d4057b6d0df051a97e4f0
msgid "无序采样"
msgstr "Disorder Sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:68
#: ccc2b737e2ee46c89fcf2594adc829b1
msgid "选中的磁矩如何变化（mode）"
msgstr "How Selected Moments Change (mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:70
#: 3d6f7386cafd417aa0cef9be1361db6f
msgid "`Flip fraction` 翻转方向，`Randomize fraction` 在完整球面取新方向，`Cone disorder` 在各磁矩原方向周围的圆锥内取新方向。"
msgstr ""
"`Flip fraction` reverses directions, `Randomize fraction` samples new directions over"
" the full sphere, and `Cone disorder` samples new directions in cones around the "
"original directions of individual moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:72
#: f0ccc72c005d4bdca496cac9154aa303
msgid "改变磁矩的比例（fractions）"
msgstr "Changed-Moment Fractions (fractions)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:74
#: 4f3b9626e41944c19b6b79e4ff83d4d9
msgid "每个值必须在 $(0,1]$。可用最小值、最大值和步长，也可切换为自定义列表。"
msgstr ""
"Every value must lie in $(0,1]$. Specify a minimum, maximum, and step, or switch to a"
" custom list."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:76
#: 3aba8e07812a46fea589c1492d3d1cbf
msgid "每个比例的样本数（samples_per_fraction）"
msgstr "Samples per Fraction (samples_per_fraction)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:78
#: cc0dfa35f31249ebab2f92a4ca379fb9
msgid "同一比例下独立随机选择的次数；增加它可以覆盖更多不同的局部组合。"
msgstr ""
"Number of independent random selections at the same fraction. Increasing it covers "
"more distinct local combinations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:80
#: 6b85a5d41ddf4c2488fbb6d4f2e94987
msgid "最大锥角（cone_angle）"
msgstr "Maximum Cone Angle (cone_angle)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:82
#: dbb95bfb645a454d95f80bc7e9f96673
msgid "仅用于 `Cone disorder`，范围为 $0^\\circ$ 到 $180^\\circ$；角度越大，方向无序越强。"
msgstr ""
"Used only by `Cone disorder`, in the range $0^\\circ$ to $180^\\circ$. Larger angles "
"produce stronger directional disorder."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:84
#: 02dae63ade9b4a73abb39a253313fcce
msgid "磁矩来源与目标"
msgstr "Moment Source and Targets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:86
#: 02a6d72ba8064057908aedce1302fe09
msgid ""
"默认读取输入结构已有的 `spin:R:3` 或 ASE "
"`initial_magmoms`。只有需要由元素表重新构造磁矩，或只处理指定元素时，才展开“磁矩来源和目标筛选”。"
msgstr ""
"By default, the card reads existing `spin:R:3` or ASE `initial_magmoms` from the "
"input. Expand `Moment source and target filter` only when moments must be "
"reconstructed from an element table or processing should be restricted to specified "
"elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:88
#: 2ad91bb9bdfd497d82acb2002e22f71d
msgid "磁矩来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "Moment Source (magnitude_source)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:90
#: 4cff6cfb16904e1483c9e2449c6d4e4b
msgid "选择读取现有 `spin:R:3`/`initial_magmoms`，或按元素磁矩表和默认值构造。"
msgstr ""
"Choose either to read existing `spin:R:3` / `initial_magmoms` or to construct moments"
" from an element table and default value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:92
#: eed10a72d7e941ecb736d4767b4cd5a9
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:94
#: 6761b4f98dc04c48b703936064b96ef2
msgid "按 `元素:模长` 填写，例如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。"
msgstr "Enter `Element:Magnitude`, for example `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:96
#: f4970fc0265d453db00dec51bca4739d
msgid "默认磁矩大小（default_moment）"
msgstr "Default Moment Magnitude (default_moment)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:98
#: feedc21023904a17b7210297ae805171
msgid "只用于元素表中没有列出的元素，默认 `0`。"
msgstr "Used only for elements absent from the element table; default `0`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:100
#: a02db1e630f349d0b8706cda42a3521c
msgid "将标量磁矩提升为矢量（lift_scalar）"
msgstr "Lift Scalar Moments to Vectors (lift_scalar)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:102
#: 85f011064c2a409789eac91f4bd902c2
msgid "读取现有标量磁矩时，将它们沿参考方向转成三维矢量。"
msgstr ""
"When existing scalar moments are read, convert them to three-dimensional vectors "
"along the reference direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:104
#: 6eef9e9288d64aa8b7b8edf178984366
msgid "标量提升方向（axis）"
msgstr "Scalar Lifting Direction (axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:106
#: f6b0cd22c55f46e69b0474cb40c685b6
msgid "只用于标量磁矩或元素表构造，不会覆盖已有矢量磁矩的方向。"
msgstr ""
"Used only for scalar moments or construction from the element table; it does not "
"overwrite directions of existing vector moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:108
#: 40ce52a9613a46768afd2c39e1870a9b
msgid "目标元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "Target Elements (apply_elements)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:110
#: 5876e7c22c3946c6afa6ad2c7af1c79e
msgid "用逗号分隔，如 `Fe,Co`；留空表示所有非零磁矩。"
msgstr "Comma-separated, for example `Fe,Co`; empty means all nonzero moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:112
#: 19a306463fb04b0181669d795748e819
msgid "随机性与输出"
msgstr "Randomness and Output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:114
#: d1a1dbf0cdcb4a88a93c1506067d4d94
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:116
#: 3b26dee4576a4597a9bbdb540ea45309
msgid "开启后使用指定 seed，同一输入和参数可复现同一批选择与方向。"
msgstr ""
"When enabled, use the specified seed so that the same input and parameters reproduce "
"the same selections and directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:118
#: 34ec06a6389c479aa1c7f9cf358ef8a3
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:120
#: bdbd9afad8b64fff87f67431c129f904
msgid "非负整数；只有开启“使用随机种子”时才生效。"
msgstr "Nonnegative integer; used only when `Use random seed` is enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:122
#: 57d2650c6d9d441bb6dff7d1e21271ef
msgid "每个输入的最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Maximum Outputs per Input (max_outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:124
#: a9546ae2687b42ca94830daf08e59df9
msgid "限制单个输入结构生成的结果数，默认 `100`；多个输入分别应用此上限。"
msgstr ""
"Limits the result count generated from one input structure; default `100`. The limit "
"is applied separately to multiple inputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:126
#: 4541179203f147689fbac3c61c81aa06
msgid "输出与检查"
msgstr "Output and Checks"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:128
#: c7a196357b824e5c921f088f143b0554
msgid "输出结构写入三列矢量磁矩 `spin:R:3`，标签格式为："
msgstr ""
"Output structures contain three-column vector moments `spin:R:3` and use labels of "
"the form:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:130
#: 8fabe77d4a01441ba394f34fa4cfc290
msgid "SpinDis(f=比例,n=实际改变数,mode=flip|rand|cone,...)\n"
msgstr "SpinDis(f=fraction,n=actual changed count,mode=flip|rand|cone,...)\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:134
#: a896dfc134154b359a746ebef17b4fec
msgid "建议先检查三件事："
msgstr "Check three points first:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:136
#: 980ad07f3a384f58bbf2e2608f1b1f44
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`n` 是否符合 $\\operatorname{round}(fN_m)$；"
msgstr "whether `n` agrees with $\\operatorname{round}(fN_m)$;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:137
#: 7bc6200ad4644b4dbf1ab6863780170d
msgid "未选中的磁矩是否保持不变；"
msgstr "whether unselected moments remain unchanged;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:138
#: 554b657dc84640548902e341b549209f
msgid "所有磁矩的模长是否保持不变。"
msgstr "whether every moment magnitude remains unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:140
#: 2836b381fb5b454ea2387dd99decc0e1
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:142
#: a89e22bebcd049819b3df12797cc6ecf
msgid "**提示找不到可用磁矩。** 输入没有非零磁矩，或目标元素没有匹配到非零磁矩。先用“设置磁矩”或“磁序”初始化。"
msgstr ""
"**No usable moments are found.** The input has no nonzero moments, or the target "
"elements match none of the nonzero moments. Initialize them first with Set Magnetic "
"Moments or Magnetic Order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:144
#: 6f3c083d643646e9a92a030813f20b10
msgid "**锥形无序看起来不像完全 PM。** 它只在每个原方向附近采样。需要完整球面方向时选择“随机化一定比例”。"
msgstr ""
"**Cone disorder does not look like a fully PM state.** It samples only around each "
"original direction. Choose `Randomize fraction` when full-sphere directions are "
"required."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/spin-disorder-card.md:146
