#~ "`Set Magnetic Moments` -> `Spin Disorder` ->"
#~ " `Small-Angle Spin Tilt`: define magnitudes, "
#~ "apply discrete disorder, then add small "
#~ "angular deviations."

#~ msgid "`Spin Disorder → Geometry Filter`：磁性结构如果同时经过强几何扰动，后面接几何清洗。"
